BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:recqxz0jf9grAksZE-single@turn-tigard
DTSTAMP:20260722T081247Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T170000
SUMMARY:Fundraiser for ICE-impacted families
DESCRIPTION:Organized by Tualatin Valley DSA in collaboration with Centro C
 ultural. This fundraiser will directly support rental assistance for ICE-i
 mpacted families at risk of eviction. \n\nJoin us for a live DJ\, dancing\
 , food\, drinks\, and a chance to win some big prizes through our loteria-
 inspired gift bags\, with prizes valued as high as $500. Loteria grab bags
  will be sold at an additional cost of $40. Plus\, auctioning prizes inclu
 ding Mexico getaway package\, gift certificate to Crazy Fish Taco\, and a 
 Cenote Elvira Experience! \n\nMinimum suggested donation: $20\n\nTickets s
 old online or at the door.\n\nEveryone receives one free drink upon entry.
 \n\nALL AGES WELCOME!
LOCATION:The 649\, 18647 SW Farmington Rd\, Beaverton\, OR 97007
URL:https://pro.gofundme.com/event/tualatin-valley-dsa-fundraiser-for-centr
 o-at-the-649/e810232
END:VEVENT
